direction: right
title: Exact Class Loading & Instance Initialization Order

Phase1: Phase 1 Class Loading (<clinit>) - Once {
  style.fill: "#0B132B"
  style.stroke: "#1D4ED8"
  
  S1: 1. Superclass Static Initializers {
    desc: "Static fields & static { } blocks run in textual order"
  }
  
  S2: 2. Subclass Static Initializers {
    desc: "Subclass static fields & static { } blocks run in textual order"
  }
  
  S1 -> S2
}

Phase2: Phase 2 Instance Instantiation (<init>) - Per 'new' {
  style.fill: "#06201B"
  style.stroke: "#047857"
  
  S3: 3. Superclass Instance Fields & { } Init Blocks
  S4: 4. Superclass Constructor Body
  S5: 5. Subclass Instance Fields & { } Init Blocks
  S6: 6. Subclass Constructor Body
  
  S3 -> S4 -> S5 -> S6
}

Phase1 -> Phase2: First 'new' triggers Phase 1 then Phase 2 {
  style.stroke: "#10B981"
}
